OL,3,GNEWSARising star to play at World Darts
OL,4,AChampionship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rising darts star is set to make his
OL,7,Fdreams a reality by playing at this
OL,8,Fyear's World Darts Championship at
OL,9,FAlexandra Palace.
OL,11,FHenry Coates, 20, secured his place in
OL,12,FDecember's tournament after a
OL,13,Fbreakthrough year which saw him become
OL,14,Fonly the fifth player to win a
OL,15,FProfessional Darts Corporation (PDC)
OL,16,Franking title without a tour card.
OL,18,FCoates, from Matlock, Derbyshire, also
OL,19,Fnarrowly lost 5-4 to former world
OL,20,Fchampion Michael van Gerwen during his
OL,21,F"incredible" Grand Slam of Darts debut
OL,22,Fon Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
